(5261842, 765744, 79079, '<td valign="top">I love the subject, but it feels like an awkward crop -- want to see either more or less on top and right sides...</td>', 'I love the subject, but it feels like an awkward crop -- want to see either more or less on top and right sides...', '2009-02-18 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261854, 765817, 96881, '<td valign="top">The Noise in this photo is going to hurt you with Voters.  The Flare from all of the lights also have caused large, overexposed areas that detract.  This may have been the intent, but it doesn''t work for me..  The colour of the Duotone also doesn''t appeal for me.  A straight Black and White may have worked better.</td>', 'The Noise in this photo is going to hurt you with Voters.  The Flare from all of the lights also have caused large, overexposed areas that detract.  This may have been the intent, but it doesn''t work for me..  The colour of the Duotone also doesn''t appeal for me.  A straight Black and White may have worked better.', '2009-02-18 00:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261857, 766056, 40718, '<td valign="top">Winner. :)</td>', 'Winner. :)', '2009-02-18 00:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261864, 765716, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am not sure that cropping out part of the car is a good idea, as it gives an unfinished look to the image.  The front on shot means the Pumps merge in with the Shop windows.  This means the photo looks like a bunch of colour, with no place for the eyes to focus on.  A different angle may have helped this</td>', 'I am not sure that cropping out part of the car is a good idea, as it gives an unfinished look to the image.  The front on shot means the Pumps merge in with the Shop windows.  This means the photo looks like a bunch of colour, with no place for the eyes to focus on.  A different angle may have helped this', '2009-02-18 00:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261871, 765848, 94855, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2009-02-18 00:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261875, 766254, 96881, '<td valign="top">I feel the crop restricts this photo.  A little more sky would have helped, and some extra space on both sides of the image, especially the right.  The image feels top heavy, as there is a large, plain area in the front caused by the driveway.  This needed to be balanced with the extra room.<br/> <br/>I like the B&amp;W processing.  It suits this image and helps in the stroy......</td>', 'I feel the crop restricts this photo.  A little more sky would have helped, and some extra space on both sides of the image, especially the right.  The image feels top heavy, as there is a large, plain area in the front caused by the driveway.  This needed to be balanced with the extra room. I like the B&W processing.  It suits this image and helps in the stroy......', '2009-02-18 00:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261876, 765316, 94855, '<td valign="top">I wish someone would put that sign on my family!</td>', 'I wish someone would put that sign on my family!', '2009-02-18 00:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261888, 766056, 94855, '<td valign="top">I really think this pic has the potential to be really great maybejust a little more focused in on the light and the pump and the garbage not so spread out but cool</td>', 'I really think this pic has the potential to be really great maybejust a little more focused in on the light and the pump and the garbage not so spread out but cool', '2009-02-18 00:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261890, 766297, 61961, '<td valign="top">Although I''m usually not a fan of such heavy processing, it really works for me in this case.</td>', 'Although I''m usually not a fan of such heavy processing, it really works for me in this case.', '2009-02-18 00:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261894, 765762, 46046, '<td valign="top">that is what I searched out too!  yours is older than mine....nice shot</td>', 'that is what I searched out too!  yours is older than mine....nice shot', '2009-02-18 00:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261895, 766081, 96881, '<td valign="top">The large Oblisk (I can''t spell) is what draws my attention, instead of the Gas station, which is dark and hidden in behind.  i can barely make out the details of it, when it is meant to be the focus of the Challenge.<br/>The processing is good, I like the B&amp;W used here.</td>', 'The large Oblisk (I can''t spell) is what draws my attention, instead of the Gas station, which is dark and hidden in behind.  i can barely make out the details of it, when it is meant to be the focus of the Challenge.The processing is good, I like the B&W used here.', '2009-02-18 00:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261897, 766271, 46046, '<td valign="top">very nice comp</td>', 'very nice comp', '2009-02-18 00:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261908, 766307, 33068, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  What a gem of a place.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Oh wow.  What a gem of a place.  Nice shot!', '2009-02-18 00:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261909, 765591, 96881, '<td valign="top">You need to use all the available pixels for your image.  The longest size can be 640, so before submitting, adjust the size.  If the image is too big in file size, adjust the quality to get the size.  I can''t see the details here, and many will mark you down for it.<br/> <br/>from what I can see, the image is an interesting shot of a bowser, with the front cover off, showing the workings.  Would love to see it larger to see the detail.</td>', 'You need to use all the available pixels for your image.  The longest size can be 640, so before submitting, adjust the size.  If the image is too big in file size, adjust the quality to get the size.  I can''t see the details here, and many will mark you down for it. from what I can see, the image is an interesting shot of a bowser, with the front cover off, showing the workings.  Would love to see it larger to see the detail.', '2009-02-18 00:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261914, 766124, 46046, '<td valign="top">I think you may have had a winner here if you''d gone tighter on the gauge and left out a large portion of the hose.  nice thinking though.  nice texture in the wall......maybe a little oblique flash to accentuate that texture a little more.  <br/> <br/>funny, just like when I go through my images critiques are so much easier made in front of a computer monitor.  GL</td>', 'I think you may have had a winner here if you''d gone tighter on the gauge and left out a large portion of the hose.  nice thinking though.  nice texture in the wall......maybe a little oblique flash to accentuate that texture a little more.   funny, just like when I go through my images critiques are so much easier made in front of a computer monitor.  GL', '2009-02-18 00:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261920, 766056, 33068, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea.  Like the mood you''ve created.</td>', 'Very nice idea.  Like the mood you''ve created.', '2009-02-18 00:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
