(5261933, 765973, 33068, '<td valign="top">Nice pov and color.  I don''t care for the border though.</td>', 'Nice pov and color.  I don''t care for the border though.', '2009-02-18 00:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261934, 765952, 96881, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, yes, you have tried to tie this to the Challenge with the title, but that doesn''t really work for me.  She looks a little young to be a gas station owner.  The shirt does have connections to the title, so I can see that meets the challenge.  Not a fan of the angle of the shot, the stance, the background, or the colours.<br/> <br/>Meeting the Challenge more strongly and in a more obvious way, photographing against something that is not distracting (plain wall perhaps, or just the curtains, not the roof as well)  PP the colours will all help later challenges.</td>', 'Hmmmm, yes, you have tried to tie this to the Challenge with the title, but that doesn''t really work for me.  She looks a little young to be a gas station owner.  The shirt does have connections to the title, so I can see that meets the challenge.  Not a fan of the angle of the shot, the stance, the background, or the colours. Meeting the Challenge more strongly and in a more obvious way, photographing against something that is not distracting (plain wall perhaps, or just the curtains, not the roof as well)  PP the colours will all help later challenges.', '2009-02-18 00:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261940, 765650, 100301, '<td valign="top">came here looking for a shot like this, you didn''t dissapoint! 10</td>', 'came here looking for a shot like this, you didn''t dissapoint! 10', '2009-02-18 00:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261943, 766197, 46046, '<td valign="top">I really like the comp!  boring photo without all the negative space.......good thinking!</td>', 'I really like the comp!  boring photo without all the negative space.......good thinking!', '2009-02-18 00:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261944, 765626, 46046, '<td valign="top">nice angle!</td>', 'nice angle!', '2009-02-18 00:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261947, 766233, 94855, '<td valign="top">I like it b ut seems a bit out of focus</td>', 'I like it b ut seems a bit out of focus', '2009-02-18 00:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261952, 766172, 94855, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2009-02-18 00:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261954, 765744, 100301, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the color version, but in black and white perhaps a little more contrast? Those are classic pumps, nice find.</td>', 'I''d like to see the color version, but in black and white perhaps a little more contrast? Those are classic pumps, nice find.', '2009-02-18 00:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261955, 765321, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great location find!  I know these things aren''t always in our control, but I''m not crazy about the white sky.  I can''t help but wish the front was lit by the rising or setting sun.  The crop on the right seems a bit awkward as well.</td>', 'Great location find!  I know these things aren''t always in our control, but I''m not crazy about the white sky.  I can''t help but wish the front was lit by the rising or setting sun.  The crop on the right seems a bit awkward as well.', '2009-02-18 00:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261967, 766207, 100301, '<td valign="top">black and white was a great choice here, composition is strong</td>', 'black and white was a great choice here, composition is strong', '2009-02-18 00:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261976, 766271, 100301, '<td valign="top">nice composition!  Where did the pumps go?  I like all the colors here, classic.</td>', 'nice composition!  Where did the pumps go?  I like all the colors here, classic.', '2009-02-18 00:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261985, 765395, 96881, '<td valign="top">Yes it is!!!<br/>I am not a fan of overexposed photography, especially when it is THIS overexposed.  It does not appeal to me, either achieved through the camera, or through PP.<br/>You have managed to retain the Shell Shop label, and a couple of the numbers.  I wish I could make out the pumps etc.  I think you have taken this from an angle, that with correct exposure, it could have been an interesting shot, but as it is, it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Yes it is!!!I am not a fan of overexposed photography, especially when it is THIS overexposed.  It does not appeal to me, either achieved through the camera, or through PP.You have managed to retain the Shell Shop label, and a couple of the numbers.  I wish I could make out the pumps etc.  I think you have taken this from an angle, that with correct exposure, it could have been an interesting shot, but as it is, it doesn''t work for me.', '2009-02-18 00:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261988, 765837, 96881, '<td valign="top">I would have attempted to keep the end of the nozzel in focus.  I like the background blurred, as it draws attention to the pump handle.  The details in the rusted metal are great.  A slightly wider DOF would have made all the difference as this could then have been one of the standouts of the challenge.  Still reat composition, and PP.  Like the colours and Duotone used.</td>', 'I would have attempted to keep the end of the nozzel in focus.  I like the background blurred, as it draws attention to the pump handle.  The details in the rusted metal are great.  A slightly wider DOF would have made all the difference as this could then have been one of the standouts of the challenge.  Still reat composition, and PP.  Like the colours and Duotone used.', '2009-02-18 00:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5261992, 765905, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The best I have seen so far.  Well exposed with tricky conditions, great composition in the photo.  Colours are pretty good (a little more punch int he red might have helped)  Border is good and works for this.  Very little to suggest.  Well done.</td>', 'I like this.  The best I have seen so far.  Well exposed with tricky conditions, great composition in the photo.  Colours are pretty good (a little more punch int he red might have helped)  Border is good and works for this.  Very little to suggest.  Well done.', '2009-02-18 00:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262000, 766183, 96881, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether you used a tripod, as is seems that the photo, especially in rhe lights etc, is not as sharp as it could have been.   I feel there is too much dead space in the middle with the footprints in the snow.  Teh rain does not help the photo either (but not much you can do about that).  I can''t see the signs for the servos, the prices etc, which could then have added to this.......</td>', 'I don''t know whether you used a tripod, as is seems that the photo, especially in rhe lights etc, is not as sharp as it could have been.   I feel there is too much dead space in the middle with the footprints in the snow.  Teh rain does not help the photo either (but not much you can do about that).  I can''t see the signs for the servos, the prices etc, which could then have added to this.......', '2009-02-18 00:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262008, 766271, 90952, '<td valign="top">Where is the gas?</td>', 'Where is the gas?', '2009-02-18 01:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262009, 765908, 96881, '<td valign="top">So will you fill up my car while I am in the Temple?????<br/> <br/>Hopefully people look closly enough at this photo to see the pojt of it, and how it meets the challenge, rather than the 2 sec glance and wack you for it.  Well spotted to get this type of picture.  Shame we can''t control the weather, as the sky is a little bit of nothing.  A nice blue sky with a cloud would have added some extra colour into the photo whcih could have helped you as well.Good angle.  probably not possible to isolate the steeple from the background buildings (bloody buildings always in the way)<br/> <br/>Like the car just leaving, ht esign is there to see.  Very different and a good change from the standard petrol station shot</td>', 'So will you fill up my car while I am in the Temple????? Hopefully people look closly enough at this photo to see the pojt of it, and how it meets the challenge, rather than the 2 sec glance and wack you for it.  Well spotted to get this type of picture.  Shame we can''t control the weather, as the sky is a little bit of nothing.  A nice blue sky with a cloud would have added some extra colour into the photo whcih could have helped you as well.Good angle.  probably not possible to isolate the steeple from the background buildings (bloody buildings always in the way) Like the car just leaving, ht esign is there to see.  Very different and a good change from the standard petrol station shot', '2009-02-18 01:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262016, 766288, 46046, '<td valign="top">would have personally liked a little more contrast .... but very nice image  GL</td>', 'would have personally liked a little more contrast .... but very nice image  GL', '2009-02-18 01:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262028, 766287, 96881, '<td valign="top">Simple, and yet elegant.  Different to the rest.  Seeing something differently to what the others have seen, and then capturing it well.<br/>Control of the lighting would have been a challenge, but you have done that well.<br/>Maybe having the top of the pump where the nozzel goes into the bowser couold have improved, rather than the spot it is here.</td>', 'Simple, and yet elegant.  Different to the rest.  Seeing something differently to what the others have seen, and then capturing it well.Control of the lighting would have been a challenge, but you have done that well.Maybe having the top of the pump where the nozzel goes into the bowser couold have improved, rather than the spot it is here.', '2009-02-18 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262030, 766274, 96881, '<td valign="top">A different perspective, but  it doesn;t work for me.  The elements surrounding the mirror distract.  Some cars in the station may have helped give the image some colour, which is is really lacking.</td>', 'A different perspective, but  it doesn;t work for me.  The elements surrounding the mirror distract.  Some cars in the station may have helped give the image some colour, which is is really lacking.', '2009-02-18 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262036, 765737, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like this.  A great image of times gone past.  Maybe a little dark.  Would have been hard to lighten much, but a ittle would make the Shell on top of the building stand out a little more, while avoiding blowing out the lights too badly.  Shame it wasn;t Advanced Editing then you could have achieved it easily.<br/>Composition is great.  One of the best images.</td>', 'I like this.  A great image of times gone past.  Maybe a little dark.  Would have been hard to lighten much, but a ittle would make the Shell on top of the building stand out a little more, while avoiding blowing out the lights too badly.  Shame it wasn;t Advanced Editing then you could have achieved it easily.Composition is great.  One of the best images.', '2009-02-18 01:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262085, 765103, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and beautiful b/w.</td>', 'Nicely composed and beautiful b/w.', '2009-02-18 02:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262087, 765828, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of the crop and angle you have applied to this image.  The top of the roof has been cropped off, as well as the lower part of the pumps and car.  I don''t see how either crop helps the photo.  Using such traditional elements, a more traditional angle and crop with space, using rule of thirds and the like, I feel would be much more suitable.  The subject matter is great for this (I wish I had this for the challenge).<br/>The car is very dark.  Some light from the front to light the car and the front pump would have been great, and made them more prominent, withot blowing out the front sign and areas already lit.</td>', 'I am not a fan of the crop and angle you have applied to this image.  The top of the roof has been cropped off, as well as the lower part of the pumps and car.  I don''t see how either crop helps the photo.  Using such traditional elements, a more traditional angle and crop with space, using rule of thirds and the like, I feel would be much more suitable.  The subject matter is great for this (I wish I had this for the challenge).The car is very dark.  Some light from the front to light the car and the front pump would have been great, and made them more prominent, withot blowing out the front sign and areas already lit.', '2009-02-18 02:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262090, 766271, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!</td>', 'Great perspective!', '2009-02-18 02:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262093, 765684, 73056, '<td valign="top">So busy - but it works!</td>', 'So busy - but it works!', '2009-02-18 02:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262096, 765815, 96881, '<td valign="top">Audi''s are expensive to fix.  He probably put the Audi double the price formula to the quote.  And i wish I was getting $104 AN HOUR.  Nice idea, different from all the rest which is a welcome change.  The surrounding elements all work, giving colour, and contect to the photo, without taking away from the main theme either.  Angle is good, the dry coffee ring of the table, the attention to detail all works here.</td>', 'Audi''s are expensive to fix.  He probably put the Audi double the price formula to the quote.  And i wish I was getting $104 AN HOUR.  Nice idea, different from all the rest which is a welcome change.  The surrounding elements all work, giving colour, and contect to the photo, without taking away from the main theme either.  Angle is good, the dry coffee ring of the table, the attention to detail all works here.', '2009-02-18 02:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262097, 766038, 73056, '<td valign="top">I like the processing, angle and edge to this. Great eye and artistic feeling to it!</td>', 'I like the processing, angle and edge to this. Great eye and artistic feeling to it!', '2009-02-18 02:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262099, 765643, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and comp to this!</td>', 'Nice perspective and comp to this!', '2009-02-18 02:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262100, 765822, 96881, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field for this becomes a distraction.  The reflections off the side mirror draw attention.  The crop and angle do not really work for me either</td>', 'The shallow depth of field for this becomes a distraction.  The reflections off the side mirror draw attention.  The crop and angle do not really work for me either', '2009-02-18 02:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262103, 765621, 73056, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and composition on this.</td>', 'Love the perspective and composition on this.', '2009-02-18 02:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262104, 766066, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and comp.</td>', 'Nice shot and comp.', '2009-02-18 02:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262106, 766015, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2009-02-18 02:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262110, 765626, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the subject. Great comp and perfect as a b/w.</td>', 'Nice take on the subject. Great comp and perfect as a b/w.', '2009-02-18 02:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262111, 765087, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice quaint little Service Station.  The picture appears soft in places.  A blue sky would have been nice, but we don''t control the weather.  The colours though seem to lack something.  Some increased Saturation and Contrast would have helped this significantly, and given the photo much more punch.  AT the moment it feels a little washed out.....</td>', 'Nice quaint little Service Station.  The picture appears soft in places.  A blue sky would have been nice, but we don''t control the weather.  The colours though seem to lack something.  Some increased Saturation and Contrast would have helped this significantly, and given the photo much more punch.  AT the moment it feels a little washed out.....', '2009-02-18 02:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5262121, 765451, 73056, '<td valign="top">Ain''t that the truth!</td>', 'Ain''t that the truth!', '2009-02-18 02:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
