(5263289, 766193, 101668, '<td valign="top">Once again not original but a damn good picture. I love the colours but not the set up. I would not have cropped it at the bottom.</td>', 'Once again not original but a damn good picture. I love the colours but not the set up. I would not have cropped it at the bottom.', '2009-02-18 14:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
