(5263320, 765451, 98141, '<td valign="top">Lol, love the Miller Lite cans on back. I think a slightly lower angle would make this a little more visually interesting for me, but really clever idea.</td>', 'Lol, love the Miller Lite cans on back. I think a slightly lower angle would make this a little more visually interesting for me, but really clever idea.', '2009-02-18 14:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263321, 765591, 98141, '<td valign="top">This pic comes up realllly tiny on my screen, so it''s hard to talk about it much. Composition looks pretty basic. I think I''d like this if I could see it better. Make sure to take advantage of as big a pic as you can post here.</td>', 'This pic comes up realllly tiny on my screen, so it''s hard to talk about it much. Composition looks pretty basic. I think I''d like this if I could see it better. Make sure to take advantage of as big a pic as you can post here.', '2009-02-18 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263324, 765563, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s behind you, but if it''s just a field I think I would like this better with a field than a building in the background. Cool subject.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s behind you, but if it''s just a field I think I would like this better with a field than a building in the background. Cool subject.', '2009-02-18 14:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263326, 765874, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the vacant feeling of this pic. I don''t think it has a strong central focus/subject though or anything that visually seperates it from the pack.</td>', 'I like the colors and the vacant feeling of this pic. I don''t think it has a strong central focus/subject though or anything that visually seperates it from the pack.', '2009-02-18 14:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263330, 765565, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this pic has a lot of potential, but I''m going to pick at it a little: Careful not to get your own shadow in the pic. The black bit at the upper left on the top is distracting, I would crop that out. Also, this feels just ever so slightly blurry to me, so make sure to get a good focus on your subject and use a tripod if you have access to one.</td>', 'I think this pic has a lot of potential, but I''m going to pick at it a little: Careful not to get your own shadow in the pic. The black bit at the upper left on the top is distracting, I would crop that out. Also, this feels just ever so slightly blurry to me, so make sure to get a good focus on your subject and use a tripod if you have access to one.', '2009-02-18 14:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263331, 766058, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ha! I like this a lot. The lines and the composition are really interesting, and the little red "Help" down at the bottom is funny too.</td>', 'Ha! I like this a lot. The lines and the composition are really interesting, and the little red "Help" down at the bottom is funny too.', '2009-02-18 14:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
