(5263334, 765815, 98141, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the thought and time that it seems went into this. I smiled, that''s for sure. I think a shot of this that included the character''s dirty face would be interesting.</td>', 'I appreciate the thought and time that it seems went into this. I smiled, that''s for sure. I think a shot of this that included the character''s dirty face would be interesting.', '2009-02-18 14:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
