(5264266, 765928, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks more like 59 gallons, if I were to be nitpicky about what the pump reads. Nice retro look to this. Not sure there is a real relation between the pretty model and the pump, but, heck, it''s just an interesting backdrop for her. There doesn''t have to be a story or connection.</td>', 'Looks more like 59 gallons, if I were to be nitpicky about what the pump reads. Nice retro look to this. Not sure there is a real relation between the pretty model and the pump, but, heck, it''s just an interesting backdrop for her. There doesn''t have to be a story or connection.', '2009-02-19 00:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
