(5264271, 766306, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the duotone treatment, detail and sharpness here. It''s not coming off to me really great, however. I think it may be the composition. Heavy, eye drawing object at both the top and bottom are maybe pulling my gaze in two directions, rather than toward one main subject.</td>', 'I like the duotone treatment, detail and sharpness here. It''s not coming off to me really great, however. I think it may be the composition. Heavy, eye drawing object at both the top and bottom are maybe pulling my gaze in two directions, rather than toward one main subject.', '2009-02-19 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264274, 766254, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very simple and clean composition and good, sharp detail. If not for the price sign, this could have been taken anytime over the last 30-40 years.</td>', 'A very simple and clean composition and good, sharp detail. If not for the price sign, this could have been taken anytime over the last 30-40 years.', '2009-02-19 00:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
