(5264453, 765875, 98141, '<td valign="top">I feel like if the branches that somewhat frame your shot were a little closer to you, they would do their job better, add some depth. As is, I like the colors and I''m jealous of such a sunny day wherever you are. I''d also suggest composing it with the giant yellow sign somewhere other than the center of the pic. Just my $.02.</td>', 'I feel like if the branches that somewhat frame your shot were a little closer to you, they would do their job better, add some depth. As is, I like the colors and I''m jealous of such a sunny day wherever you are. I''d also suggest composing it with the giant yellow sign somewhere other than the center of the pic. Just my $.02.', '2009-02-19 08:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264455, 766188, 98141, '<td valign="top">I pick... Green because it''s probably the cheapest! Interesting photo, I think it would also be cool to have lined them up and used a shallow dof. The car in the background is distracting to me.</td>', 'I pick... Green because it''s probably the cheapest! Interesting photo, I think it would also be cool to have lined them up and used a shallow dof. The car in the background is distracting to me.', '2009-02-19 08:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
