(5264457, 766161, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ah, Le Mighty Texaco. Cool shot, great colors, beautiful sky (I''m jealous, we''re in the middle of another winter storm here and the schools are closed again today...). I can''t say exactly what it is about this, but I enjoy it.</td>', 'Ah, Le Mighty Texaco. Cool shot, great colors, beautiful sky (I''m jealous, we''re in the middle of another winter storm here and the schools are closed again today...). I can''t say exactly what it is about this, but I enjoy it.', '2009-02-19 08:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
