(5264462, 765684, 98141, '<td valign="top">Good clarity, nothing is too blown out. I''m not sure what is the central focus here though. Also, I must admit that it bugs my brain a little to have the "o" in "connect" cut out so completely.</td>', 'Good clarity, nothing is too blown out. I''m not sure what is the central focus here though. Also, I must admit that it bugs my brain a little to have the "o" in "connect" cut out so completely.', '2009-02-19 08:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
