(5264476, 765828, 98141, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast for me, this feels a little gray and flat. Cool subject though and I think there''s a lot of potential here.</td>', 'Not enough contrast for me, this feels a little gray and flat. Cool subject though and I think there''s a lot of potential here.', '2009-02-19 08:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264477, 765954, 98141, '<td valign="top">This pic falls flat to me, there''s just not enough of a sense of distance between everything. A shallower dof aor a different angle may help?</td>', 'This pic falls flat to me, there''s just not enough of a sense of distance between everything. A shallower dof aor a different angle may help?', '2009-02-19 08:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264489, 765316, 56254, '<td valign="top">hey ... I recognize this station ... Vinsetta Garage on Woodward!  comment only, no vote ... can''t wait to see who''s image this is ...</td>', 'hey ... I recognize this station ... Vinsetta Garage on Woodward!  comment only, no vote ... can''t wait to see who''s image this is ...', '2009-02-19 08:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264542, 765440, 98141, '<td valign="top">Grimey, dark and ragged, I love it. I love the negative space above it and the colors of the rust.</td>', 'Grimey, dark and ragged, I love it. I love the negative space above it and the colors of the rust.', '2009-02-19 10:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264543, 766089, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this, very colorful, great dof, and meets the challenge in an off-beat way.</td>', 'I love this, very colorful, great dof, and meets the challenge in an off-beat way.', '2009-02-19 10:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264546, 765848, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. I''m so glad to finally see an interesting photograph of an entire gas station. This has depth, character, good lighting, good comp, great job!</td>', 'Fantastic. I''m so glad to finally see an interesting photograph of an entire gas station. This has depth, character, good lighting, good comp, great job!', '2009-02-19 10:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264547, 765218, 98141, '<td valign="top">Not particularly interesting but at least it has great dof and good lighting.</td>', 'Not particularly interesting but at least it has great dof and good lighting.', '2009-02-19 10:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264548, 765920, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this better in color if the sky is clear like I am thinking it is. Good comp but other than that it doesn''t really pop for me.</td>', 'I think I would like this better in color if the sky is clear like I am thinking it is. Good comp but other than that it doesn''t really pop for me.', '2009-02-19 10:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264549, 766311, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think that without the pamphlet and with a sharper image this would have great potential. I imagine that a really bright background (blue, red, yellow...something that pops) would be a really simple, cool way to ofset the black and white and metallic of the subject.</td>', 'I think that without the pamphlet and with a sharper image this would have great potential. I imagine that a really bright background (blue, red, yellow...something that pops) would be a really simple, cool way to ofset the black and white and metallic of the subject.', '2009-02-19 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264557, 765811, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop and tones.</td>', 'I like the tight crop and tones.', '2009-02-19 10:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264558, 766287, 33672, '<td valign="top">I was looking for the same shot. Great idea and execution.</td>', 'I was looking for the same shot. Great idea and execution.', '2009-02-19 10:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264559, 765922, 33672, '<td valign="top">tones work perfectly with the subject.</td>', 'tones work perfectly with the subject.', '2009-02-19 10:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264560, 766317, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great black and white and one of my favorites in the theme.</td>', 'Great black and white and one of my favorites in the theme.', '2009-02-19 10:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264562, 766124, 33672, '<td valign="top">Black and white works well ans does the comp.</td>', 'Black and white works well ans does the comp.', '2009-02-19 10:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264563, 765837, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on this photo.</td>', 'Nice detail on this photo.', '2009-02-19 10:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264564, 765744, 33672, '<td valign="top">You''ve successfully captured that "old" feel. Nice work.</td>', 'You''ve successfully captured that "old" feel. Nice work.', '2009-02-19 10:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264565, 766288, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice POV. I like the tones and comp too.</td>', 'Nice POV. I like the tones and comp too.', '2009-02-19 10:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264578, 765862, 103215, '<td valign="top">this is horrible</td>', 'this is horrible', '2009-02-19 10:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264585, 764711, 98141, '<td valign="top">Strange processing, I kind of like it. This feels like it was a part of a really good picture and then it was cropped too small. I wish there was more substance here.</td>', 'Strange processing, I kind of like it. This feels like it was a part of a really good picture and then it was cropped too small. I wish there was more substance here.', '2009-02-19 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264595, 766154, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the red were more saturated in this, that would make it pop more for me... Something is lacking here but I can''t put my finger on it. I think that the composition is just a little too dull perhaps?</td>', 'I wish the red were more saturated in this, that would make it pop more for me... Something is lacking here but I can''t put my finger on it. I think that the composition is just a little too dull perhaps?', '2009-02-19 10:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264596, 765626, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this is a fun shot! I like the b&amp;w here and I think this is a very clever and well-done shot.</td>', 'Whoa, this is a fun shot! I like the b&w here and I think this is a very clever and well-done shot.', '2009-02-19 10:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264597, 766254, 98141, '<td valign="top">Pretty basic, but a good pic, I like the b&amp;w for this one.</td>', 'Pretty basic, but a good pic, I like the b&w for this one.', '2009-02-19 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264599, 765905, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, I''ll look to see what lens you used after voting is over, cool pic an dgreat colors/exposure.</td>', 'I like this a lot, I''ll look to see what lens you used after voting is over, cool pic an dgreat colors/exposure.', '2009-02-19 10:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264601, 765717, 98141, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really connect with me. My favorite part of the pic is the bright red at the top of the foremost stack, but then the one behind it is so dull. The trees and the wires make this a really busy pic. Perhaps I would like it in b&amp;w?</td>', 'This doesn''t really connect with me. My favorite part of the pic is the bright red at the top of the foremost stack, but then the one behind it is so dull. The trees and the wires make this a really busy pic. Perhaps I would like it in b&w?', '2009-02-19 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264605, 765952, 98141, '<td valign="top">Background is distracting, eyes aren''t sharp and lighting is dull and feels really forced to fit the challenge.</td>', 'Background is distracting, eyes aren''t sharp and lighting is dull and feels really forced to fit the challenge.', '2009-02-19 10:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264607, 765862, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this but I can''t say why. I''m in a weird mood today where I''m liking the strange ones. I wish the colors were a little brighter. Good luck with this one ;)</td>', 'I like this but I can''t say why. I''m in a weird mood today where I''m liking the strange ones. I wish the colors were a little brighter. Good luck with this one ;)', '2009-02-19 10:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264611, 766196, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ah, D-Town. Just a sampling of what it has to offer. I don''t feel like this pic really captures the vacantness (I don''t think that''s a word?) of the lot. I think a shallower dof would give this more depth, right now the pumps fall flat with the building behind it, at least for me.</td>', 'Ah, D-Town. Just a sampling of what it has to offer. I don''t feel like this pic really captures the vacantness (I don''t think that''s a word?) of the lot. I think a shallower dof would give this more depth, right now the pumps fall flat with the building behind it, at least for me.', '2009-02-19 10:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264615, 766297, 98141, '<td valign="top">I did it, but as I said on another pic, I''m enjoying the weird ones today. Something feels very post-apocalyptic about this and it grabs me. It almost looks like dead trees and dead gas - so what happened to people without trees and gas? Perhaps this is our future?</td>', 'I did it, but as I said on another pic, I''m enjoying the weird ones today. Something feels very post-apocalyptic about this and it grabs me. It almost looks like dead trees and dead gas - so what happened to people without trees and gas? Perhaps this is our future?', '2009-02-19 10:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264646, 765548, 102394, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this shot.  The softness of focus in the background really makes the pump pop.  The numbers are hard to see because of the reflection of light.  That''s my only complaint.</td>', 'I love the composition of this shot.  The softness of focus in the background really makes the pump pop.  The numbers are hard to see because of the reflection of light.  That''s my only complaint.', '2009-02-19 11:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264655, 766058, 80458, '<td valign="top">I love the help at the bottom, but your DOF should be lower for this image.</td>', 'I love the help at the bottom, but your DOF should be lower for this image.', '2009-02-19 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264782, 765837, 102315, '<td valign="top">Love the lines in this photo.</td>', 'Love the lines in this photo.', '2009-02-19 12:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264908, 764987, 61961, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle on an old object.  I like the darkness.  It looks like there were many layers of paint over the years.</td>', 'Unusual angle on an old object.  I like the darkness.  It looks like there were many layers of paint over the years.', '2009-02-19 13:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264909, 765717, 61961, '<td valign="top">It looks like a rocket is taking off!  Normally power lines are to be avoided but in this case it adds to the overall industrial scene.  Beautiful sky color</td>', 'It looks like a rocket is taking off!  Normally power lines are to be avoided but in this case it adds to the overall industrial scene.  Beautiful sky color', '2009-02-19 13:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264910, 765973, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like the severe modern quality of the pump and the houses behind.  The glimpse of the windmill in the back makes an interesting statement (old and new power) and explains the rather awkward angle.  Too bad about the cars, especially the one behind the pump, they kind of clutter the shot.  Nice sky and overall exposure.</td>', 'I like the severe modern quality of the pump and the houses behind.  The glimpse of the windmill in the back makes an interesting statement (old and new power) and explains the rather awkward angle.  Too bad about the cars, especially the one behind the pump, they kind of clutter the shot.  Nice sky and overall exposure.', '2009-02-19 13:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264915, 766303, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice night scene.  The glowing icicles really make this for me, as does the limited color palette.</td>', 'Nice night scene.  The glowing icicles really make this for me, as does the limited color palette.', '2009-02-19 13:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264916, 766237, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like the isolated subject.  Great find, and strong colors (without being oversaturated).</td>', 'I like the isolated subject.  Great find, and strong colors (without being oversaturated).', '2009-02-19 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1);
