(5266197, 765650, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool that this old truck is there too.  You must have used a split ND filter on this to darken the sky and sign?  Works pretty well except for the sign (meaning good idea on controlling the sky).  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty cool that this old truck is there too.  You must have used a split ND filter on this to darken the sky and sign?  Works pretty well except for the sign (meaning good idea on controlling the sky).  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.', '2009-02-20 12:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266200, 766071, 99448, '<td valign="top">great shot, love the colours, i wish i taken one like this</td>', 'great shot, love the colours, i wish i taken one like this', '2009-02-20 12:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266203, 765626, 30049, '<td valign="top">:-)  This is the photo I was going to take (honest, ask my teammates!).  Ended up going a totally different direction.  B/W works well with this.  Good luck!</td>', ':-)  This is the photo I was going to take (honest, ask my teammates!).  Ended up going a totally different direction.  B/W works well with this.  Good luck!', '2009-02-20 12:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266204, 765737, 30049, '<td valign="top">Where is this place?  Looks like I''ve seen this same station 3 or 4 times now.  I like the time of day that you took this.  Works well with the lights.  Kind of with you''d taken a bit off the bottom on this.  BTW - what''s "Free"?  Kittens or something?  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Where is this place?  Looks like I''ve seen this same station 3 or 4 times now.  I like the time of day that you took this.  Works well with the lights.  Kind of with you''d taken a bit off the bottom on this.  BTW - what''s "Free"?  Kittens or something?  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-02-20 12:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266373, 766183, 30049, '<td valign="top">Liked the view better back where you started, eh?  :-)  This is a unique view.  The competing color temps in the various lights throws this off some (not much you could do about that).  Yellow won.</td>', 'Liked the view better back where you started, eh?  :-)  This is a unique view.  The competing color temps in the various lights throws this off some (not much you could do about that).  Yellow won.', '2009-02-20 14:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266376, 765293, 30049, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the underside of the island roof is quite interesting.  Could almost make an abstract out of that by itself.  It appears that you were trying to capture the entire scene...sometimes it''s better to isolate.  Look at this with a crop that removes a good chunk of the bottom, the right (getting rid of car), and some off the left a little.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'The reflections on the underside of the island roof is quite interesting.  Could almost make an abstract out of that by itself.  It appears that you were trying to capture the entire scene...sometimes it''s better to isolate.  Look at this with a crop that removes a good chunk of the bottom, the right (getting rid of car), and some off the left a little. All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.', '2009-02-20 14:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266377, 766058, 30049, '<td valign="top">HELP  :-D  That worked out great - especially being just above the title.</td>', 'HELP  :-D  That worked out great - especially being just above the title.', '2009-02-20 14:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266383, 766056, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Here''s a Ribbon Winner for sure!  Great catch!  Good idea stopping down enough to catch some natural starburst with the light.  Subject perfectly positioned in the frame - very cool natural vignette.  Yep, yep - Nice job.</td>', 'Ok.  Here''s a Ribbon Winner for sure!  Great catch!  Good idea stopping down enough to catch some natural starburst with the light.  Subject perfectly positioned in the frame - very cool natural vignette.  Yep, yep - Nice job.', '2009-02-20 14:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266389, 766272, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great use of color, and a very pleasing comp.</td>', 'Great use of color, and a very pleasing comp.', '2009-02-20 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266394, 764987, 30049, '<td valign="top">Seems a little dark and lacking in contrast.  Could be this monitor...I''ll check back later on one that''s calibrated.</td>', 'Seems a little dark and lacking in contrast.  Could be this monitor...I''ll check back later on one that''s calibrated.', '2009-02-20 15:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266396, 766287, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple (stockish), with great color...should do well with this.  :-)</td>', 'Clean, simple (stockish), with great color...should do well with this.  :-)', '2009-02-20 15:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
