(5269721, 765737, 103614, '<td valign="top">Nice!!</td>', 'Nice!!', '2009-02-23 01:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270144, 765848, 90414, '<td valign="top">I like this POV. The asphalt helps balance out the blah sky.</td>', 'I like this POV. The asphalt helps balance out the blah sky.', '2009-02-23 08:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270157, 765815, 90414, '<td valign="top">This "Gas Station Voter" says 7 for originality.</td>', 'This "Gas Station Voter" says 7 for originality.', '2009-02-23 08:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270166, 766062, 90414, '<td valign="top">One of the better entries, imo, and an excellent night-shot.</td>', 'One of the better entries, imo, and an excellent night-shot.', '2009-02-23 08:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270172, 765626, 90414, '<td valign="top">Extra points for a creative POV.</td>', 'Extra points for a creative POV.', '2009-02-23 08:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270190, 765254, 90414, '<td valign="top">Hey! I was eating when I saw that!</td>', 'Hey! I was eating when I saw that!', '2009-02-23 08:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270213, 765254, 87808, '<td valign="top">How pathetically pathetic.  What exactly are you hoping for here.</td>', 'How pathetically pathetic.  What exactly are you hoping for here.', '2009-02-23 08:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270238, 765815, 87808, '<td valign="top">nicely done, fun reading</td>', 'nicely done, fun reading', '2009-02-23 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270336, 766084, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice location and composition. Great Shot</td>', 'Nice location and composition. Great Shot', '2009-02-23 10:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270338, 765451, 22970, '<td valign="top">LOL! Nice take on the challenge and NICE CAR.</td>', 'LOL! Nice take on the challenge and NICE CAR.', '2009-02-23 10:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270340, 766307, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph has a natural look for the ear. I feel I''m in a back to the future movie. Nicely done!</td>', 'Your photograph has a natural look for the ear. I feel I''m in a back to the future movie. Nicely done!', '2009-02-23 10:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270341, 765626, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice job in taking an ordinary photograph and giving the viewer an odd but interesting perspective. The B&amp;W conversion complements the POV. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice job in taking an ordinary photograph and giving the viewer an odd but interesting perspective. The B&W conversion complements the POV. Nice work.', '2009-02-23 10:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270370, 765220, 22970, '<td valign="top">You have to love the old pumps with their flare and nostalgia. Nice colors, lighting is good but would of liked to have seen a wider angle but still a nice shot.</td>', 'You have to love the old pumps with their flare and nostalgia. Nice colors, lighting is good but would of liked to have seen a wider angle but still a nice shot.', '2009-02-23 10:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270376, 765548, 22970, '<td valign="top">What I like about this photograph is your able to relate it to the challenge even though it is some what abstract. Nice focus and the texture (aging) of the pump adds a flare to the image. Nice</td>', 'What I like about this photograph is your able to relate it to the challenge even though it is some what abstract. Nice focus and the texture (aging) of the pump adds a flare to the image. Nice', '2009-02-23 10:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270382, 766197, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nothing overwhelming but a simple photograph that works well with the negative space that surrounds the subject. Good control with lighting and focus. Nice image that deserves an above avg score.</td>', 'Nothing overwhelming but a simple photograph that works well with the negative space that surrounds the subject. Good control with lighting and focus. Nice image that deserves an above avg score.', '2009-02-23 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270385, 766271, 22970, '<td valign="top">Simple but your perspective gives it depth and makes this image a joy to view. It would have been nice if the house to the left wasn''t there but I don''t think you could have done anything about that:). Nicely presented.</td>', 'Simple but your perspective gives it depth and makes this image a joy to view. It would have been nice if the house to the left wasn''t there but I don''t think you could have done anything about that:). Nicely presented.', '2009-02-23 10:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270579, 766233, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, though things seem a little soft. I see some compression artifacts around the overhead lights. Your file size of only 58k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=742828" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here is how the compression is adjusted in PaintShop Pro</a>, if it helps at all. Of course, I don''t know what you are editing with.</td>', 'Nice sunset, though things seem a little soft. I see some compression artifacts around the overhead lights. Your file size of only 58k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one) Here is how the compression is adjusted in PaintShop Pro, if it helps at all. Of course, I don''t know what you are editing with.', '2009-02-23 12:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270580, 765321, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool looking rusty old place.</td>', 'Cool looking rusty old place.', '2009-02-23 12:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270584, 766146, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of a semi abstract view. I''m not really caring for it much myself, though I do think there are some folks this will appeal to. Perhaps it is the composition. My eye wanders around and does not really get led to anything.</td>', 'Kind of a semi abstract view. I''m not really caring for it much myself, though I do think there are some folks this will appeal to. Perhaps it is the composition. My eye wanders around and does not really get led to anything.', '2009-02-23 12:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270588, 765767, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the strong perspective view. There is a fair amount of graininess, but it comes off to me as intentional and it helps the old tyme feel of this.</td>', 'I like the strong perspective view. There is a fair amount of graininess, but it comes off to me as intentional and it helps the old tyme feel of this.', '2009-02-23 12:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270591, 765396, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is that a Sinclair "brontosaurus" logo on that pump?</td>', 'Is that a Sinclair "brontosaurus" logo on that pump?', '2009-02-23 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270593, 766303, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the treatment. Nice lights reflecting off the wet pavement.</td>', 'I like the treatment. Nice lights reflecting off the wet pavement.', '2009-02-23 12:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270596, 765737, 83313, '<td valign="top">This must be the location that quite a few members live close to.  Second entry I''ve seen of this one. Nice old time feel to it.</td>', 'This must be the location that quite a few members live close to.  Second entry I''ve seen of this one. Nice old time feel to it.', '2009-02-23 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270598, 766089, 83313, '<td valign="top">Certainly something that would be found at a gas station. Fits the challenge description with some out of the box thinking.</td>', 'Certainly something that would be found at a gas station. Fits the challenge description with some out of the box thinking.', '2009-02-23 12:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270599, 766174, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice neon glow in this.</td>', 'Nice neon glow in this.', '2009-02-23 12:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270602, 765925, 83313, '<td valign="top">Busy, but it comes off well.</td>', 'Busy, but it comes off well.', '2009-02-23 12:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270685, 765862, 83313, '<td valign="top">An out the car window shot at night? Sorry, I can''t even see this as an out of the box approach</td>', 'An out the car window shot at night? Sorry, I can''t even see this as an out of the box approach', '2009-02-23 13:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270689, 766285, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off to me as a snapshot, I''m afraid. A closeup of that wrinkled receipt might have made an interesting pic.</td>', 'Comes off to me as a snapshot, I''m afraid. A closeup of that wrinkled receipt might have made an interesting pic.', '2009-02-23 13:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270694, 766287, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the nighttime lighting. I like the outlined effect that the backlighting gives it.</td>', 'Nice use of the nighttime lighting. I like the outlined effect that the backlighting gives it.', '2009-02-23 13:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270697, 766150, 83313, '<td valign="top">Deja vu... How many DPC members live near this place?!</td>', 'Deja vu... How many DPC members live near this place?!', '2009-02-23 13:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270701, 766066, 83313, '<td valign="top">Remember when the air pump was a freebie?</td>', 'Remember when the air pump was a freebie?', '2009-02-23 13:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270704, 765581, 83313, '<td valign="top">I agree with the stop part. It looks like one of those pumps stopped something at least once!</td>', 'I agree with the stop part. It looks like one of those pumps stopped something at least once!', '2009-02-23 13:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270713, 766166, 83313, '<td valign="top">The way in which the pump is cut off at the edge of the frame does not work for me. It''s jsut a bit too tight a crop. Maybe another foot or so back. (Assuming that didn''t put you in the water!)</td>', 'The way in which the pump is cut off at the edge of the frame does not work for me. It''s jsut a bit too tight a crop. Maybe another foot or so back. (Assuming that didn''t put you in the water!)', '2009-02-23 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270721, 765650, 83313, '<td valign="top">Like it. I''d like to know how you adjusted this for such a look under basic rules.</td>', 'Like it. I''d like to know how you adjusted this for such a look under basic rules.', '2009-02-23 13:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270723, 766272, 83313, '<td valign="top">Free air is such a rare thing anymore. I like this semi-absract view. Nice bold reds and strong contrast.</td>', 'Free air is such a rare thing anymore. I like this semi-absract view. Nice bold reds and strong contrast.', '2009-02-23 13:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270727, 765339, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very retro. Like it.</td>', 'Very retro. Like it.', '2009-02-23 13:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270731, 764987, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, though a touch brighter would have come off a little better for me.</td>', 'I like this, though a touch brighter would have come off a little better for me.', '2009-02-23 13:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270735, 765591, 83313, '<td valign="top">Too small and highly compressed. Good strong contrast, however.</td>', 'Too small and highly compressed. Good strong contrast, however.', '2009-02-23 13:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270740, 765293, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflections. <strike>Seems to be a bit of visible tilt, however.</strike> On the other hand, looking at the tree and the top of the awning, this is straight, but on a hill.</td>', 'Interesting reflections. Seems to be a bit of visible tilt, however. On the other hand, looking at the tree and the top of the awning, this is straight, but on a hill.', '2009-02-23 13:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270743, 766014, 83313, '<td valign="top">Minimalist but quite nice.</td>', 'Minimalist but quite nice.', '2009-02-23 13:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270744, 766238, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the title...</td>', 'Not sure I get the title...', '2009-02-23 13:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270750, 765815, 83313, '<td valign="top">You made me take more than the customary 3 seconds to vote, since I had to read the whole thing to get all the humor. Love the grease smears.</td>', 'You made me take more than the customary 3 seconds to vote, since I had to read the whole thing to get all the humor. Love the grease smears.', '2009-02-23 13:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270753, 765565, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hey look! They have pizza here! Will they deliver to our rock?</td>', 'Hey look! They have pizza here! Will they deliver to our rock?', '2009-02-23 13:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270755, 766317, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to have some jaggies ruining the details of the pump handle. Perhaps some issues with resizing? Otherwise, I like this low key approach.</td>', 'Seems to have some jaggies ruining the details of the pump handle. Perhaps some issues with resizing? Otherwise, I like this low key approach.', '2009-02-23 13:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270764, 766314, 83313, '<td valign="top">No vote from me. I knew this would not have high scoring broad appeal. (I told you so!) I still like it, though.</td>', 'No vote from me. I knew this would not have high scoring broad appeal. (I told you so!) I still like it, though.', '2009-02-23 13:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270779, 765301, 83313, '<td valign="top">Been a while since they changed that sign. Contrast is a little dull. Out of curiosity, I copied this into my photo editor and some quick adjustments bumped this up a bit and brought out some detail.</td>', 'Been a while since they changed that sign. Contrast is a little dull. Out of curiosity, I copied this into my photo editor and some quick adjustments bumped this up a bit and brought out some detail.', '2009-02-23 13:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270785, 765698, 83313, '<td valign="top">The subject is not interesting for me, but the composition leads the eye well.</td>', 'The subject is not interesting for me, but the composition leads the eye well.', '2009-02-23 13:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270790, 765395, 83313, '<td valign="top">I sure hope this is a brown effort.</td>', 'I sure hope this is a brown effort.', '2009-02-23 14:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270793, 766196, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just comes off to me as a snapshot, I''m afraid. I''m not sure what to suggest, though.</td>', 'Just comes off to me as a snapshot, I''m afraid. I''m not sure what to suggest, though.', '2009-02-23 14:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270794, 765626, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good strong contrast and a fun perspective. Good thinking on this. One of the better shots in this challenge of a modern station.</td>', 'Good strong contrast and a fun perspective. Good thinking on this. One of the better shots in this challenge of a modern station.', '2009-02-23 14:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270795, 765954, 83313, '<td valign="top">You just can''t go wrong with rust!</td>', 'You just can''t go wrong with rust!', '2009-02-23 14:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270800, 765874, 83313, '<td valign="top">I hope I don''t need a key for the restroom, because that 105 oz mega-super gulp from the last stop is making me pretty desperate.</td>', 'I hope I don''t need a key for the restroom, because that 105 oz mega-super gulp from the last stop is making me pretty desperate.', '2009-02-23 14:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270935, 766150, 24241, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but overexposed.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but overexposed.', '2009-02-23 16:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270937, 765920, 24241, '<td valign="top">What exactly would lead me to bieleve that is a gas station?</td>', 'What exactly would lead me to bieleve that is a gas station?', '2009-02-23 16:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270940, 765643, 24241, '<td valign="top">Great color and title.</td>', 'Great color and title.', '2009-02-23 16:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270943, 766193, 24241, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, composition and colors.  I would have liked more symetry on the pumps though.</td>', 'Nice subject, composition and colors.  I would have liked more symetry on the pumps though.', '2009-02-23 16:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270951, 765626, 24241, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  Hope you didn''t get too oily down there.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  Hope you didn''t get too oily down there.', '2009-02-23 16:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270972, 766312, 24983, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2009-02-23 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271080, 765650, 71657, '<td valign="top">Looks like it should be in a magazine</td>', 'Looks like it should be in a magazine', '2009-02-23 17:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271217, 765900, 103114, '<td valign="top">11</td>', '11', '2009-02-23 18:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271351, 765954, 9661, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lovely texture. The wire to the top of the pump is distracting though!</td>', 'This picture has a lovely texture. The wire to the top of the pump is distracting though!', '2009-02-23 20:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271357, 765451, 9661, '<td valign="top">This is fun!!</td>', 'This is fun!!', '2009-02-23 20:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271391, 765650, 9661, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the exposure in this frame</td>', 'I love the composition and the exposure in this frame', '2009-02-23 20:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271427, 765626, 103269, '<td valign="top">great perspective</td>', 'great perspective', '2009-02-23 21:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271568, 765451, 77724, '<td valign="top">Bonus point for the title :)</td>', 'Bonus point for the title :)', '2009-02-23 22:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271576, 765848, 77724, '<td valign="top">Intersting perspective - almoat makes it look like a model.</td>', 'Intersting perspective - almoat makes it look like a model.', '2009-02-23 22:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271579, 765954, 77724, '<td valign="top">Nice detail &amp; composition, looks a bit flat to my eye though.</td>', 'Nice detail & composition, looks a bit flat to my eye though.', '2009-02-23 22:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271687, 765815, 87724, '<td valign="top">Ah, the joys of Audi ownership.</td>', 'Ah, the joys of Audi ownership.', '2009-02-24 00:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271890, 766314, 88492, '<td valign="top">Great idea, lacks a little something in execution</td>', 'Great idea, lacks a little something in execution', '2009-02-24 08:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271892, 765848, 88492, '<td valign="top">Great angle</td>', 'Great angle', '2009-02-24 08:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271894, 766166, 88492, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2009-02-24 08:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271907, 765828, 88492, '<td valign="top">Seems to have been a popular location</td>', 'Seems to have been a popular location', '2009-02-24 08:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272086, 765925, 73942, '<td valign="top">Love the Polaroid!</td>', 'Love the Polaroid!', '2009-02-24 12:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272137, 766081, 83313, '<td valign="top">This shot has a bit of a 50''s feel to it. Looks like something I might run across while browsing a site like <a href="//www.texasfreeway.com/Dallas/historic/photos/dallas_historic_photos.shtml" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Texas Freeway</a>.</td>', 'This shot has a bit of a 50''s feel to it. Looks like something I might run across while browsing a site like Texas Freeway.', '2009-02-24 13:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272138, 765440, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice crusty rust.</td>', 'Nice crusty rust.', '2009-02-24 13:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272140, 766292, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the sunburst, though the remainder of the shot does not grab me. A good use of the midday sun, however. It''s tough to get a good shot with the sun high overhead like that. My usual approach is to concentrate on detail shots when the sun is high.</td>', 'I like the sunburst, though the remainder of the shot does not grab me. A good use of the midday sun, however. It''s tough to get a good shot with the sun high overhead like that. My usual approach is to concentrate on detail shots when the sun is high.', '2009-02-24 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272144, 766051, 83313, '<td valign="top">Crisp clear details and colors. Does not come off to me as having much composition, I''m afraid. Too many objects seem cut off at the edge of the frame.</td>', 'Crisp clear details and colors. Does not come off to me as having much composition, I''m afraid. Too many objects seem cut off at the edge of the frame.', '2009-02-24 13:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272185, 764711, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a grainy shot out your car window. At only 63k file size, there are also a lot of compression artifacts and grain showing.</td>', 'Looks like a grainy shot out your car window. At only 63k file size, there are also a lot of compression artifacts and grain showing.', '2009-02-24 14:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272192, 766237, 83313, '<td valign="top">Whatever happened to that chain of gas stations? Perhaps it is just not in my part of the country, or was absorbed in merger with another company. Checked Wikipedia. Apparently they are still around, just not in Texas.</td>', 'Whatever happened to that chain of gas stations? Perhaps it is just not in my part of the country, or was absorbed in merger with another company. Checked Wikipedia. Apparently they are still around, just not in Texas.', '2009-02-24 14:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272219, 766137, 83313, '<td valign="top">This entry is not grabbing me, I''m afraid. Hard to nail down why. Might be the color cast, or the overall contrast and color. Not totally sure. I played with it a little in paintshop pro and I liked it a bit better with less of a yellow cast from the lighting and some levels adjust. That may just be a personal preference thing.</td>', 'This entry is not grabbing me, I''m afraid. Hard to nail down why. Might be the color cast, or the overall contrast and color. Not totally sure. I played with it a little in paintshop pro and I liked it a bit better with less of a yellow cast from the lighting and some levels adjust. That may just be a personal preference thing.', '2009-02-24 14:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272222, 765436, 83313, '<td valign="top">The title is a good description. This does convey desolation. Probably a boring shift for the clerk inside.</td>', 'The title is a good description. This does convey desolation. Probably a boring shift for the clerk inside.', '2009-02-24 14:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272224, 765823, 83313, '<td valign="top">Black and red always go well together.</td>', 'Black and red always go well together.', '2009-02-24 14:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272230, 765220, 83313, '<td valign="top">Like the green and red at night. There''s a little tilt from perspective, but nothing you can do for that under basic rules. Or, maybe the pump is actually sitting on a slight tilt...</td>', 'Like the green and red at night. There''s a little tilt from perspective, but nothing you can do for that under basic rules. Or, maybe the pump is actually sitting on a slight tilt...', '2009-02-24 14:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272256, 765905, 30896, '<td valign="top">Is the bottom black stripe meant as a frame? Since the black on top is melted nicely into the picture, I found the stripe unnatural (while the rest is quite good, as most of night photos here)</td>', 'Is the bottom black stripe meant as a frame? Since the black on top is melted nicely into the picture, I found the stripe unnatural (while the rest is quite good, as most of night photos here)', '2009-02-24 15:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272262, 765684, 30896, '<td valign="top">I like the idea with the column, though the rest is a bit too busy for me. Still a plus point for originality.</td>', 'I like the idea with the column, though the rest is a bit too busy for me. Still a plus point for originality.', '2009-02-24 15:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272266, 766014, 30896, '<td valign="top">My top pick, really beautiful, especially so for the basic editing</td>', 'My top pick, really beautiful, especially so for the basic editing', '2009-02-24 15:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
