(5272637, 766317, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good job on controlling the lighting. Odd angle but works for me.</td>', 'Good job on controlling the lighting. Odd angle but works for me.', '2009-02-24 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272641, 765720, 22970, '<td valign="top">You captured this well. I think the crop may be a little to tight but without knowing the surrounding I can say for sure. Nice focus and colors. The small amount of noise in your image is a plus.</td>', 'You captured this well. I think the crop may be a little to tight but without knowing the surrounding I can say for sure. Nice focus and colors. The small amount of noise in your image is a plus.', '2009-02-24 17:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272644, 766197, 12674, '<td valign="top">Neat composition, I like how the subject is isolated by the dark.</td>', 'Neat composition, I like how the subject is isolated by the dark.', '2009-02-24 17:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272647, 766062, 22970, '<td valign="top">The neon blue on the top of the building and cover against the black sky makes your image stand out. The red tail light trails is a plus. The only thing that is somewhat distracting is the blown-out sign on the right. Nice job.</td>', 'The neon blue on the top of the building and cover against the black sky makes your image stand out. The red tail light trails is a plus. The only thing that is somewhat distracting is the blown-out sign on the right. Nice job.', '2009-02-24 17:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272651, 766287, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice control with lighting. Simple but interesting with all the curves and void space.</td>', 'Nice control with lighting. Simple but interesting with all the curves and void space.', '2009-02-24 17:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272655, 765591, 12674, '<td valign="top">You found a great subject. You''ll want to learn how to adjust the size of your image to the maximum size allowed by the rules. Larger images are easier to see and score higher.</td>', 'You found a great subject. You''ll want to learn how to adjust the size of your image to the maximum size allowed by the rules. Larger images are easier to see and score higher.', '2009-02-24 18:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272657, 766062, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, color, and movement. One of the few newer gas stations, which sets it apart.</td>', 'Nice composition, color, and movement. One of the few newer gas stations, which sets it apart.', '2009-02-24 18:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272691, 765626, 100727, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot a lot, and I hope it makes it to the top three.  The other entries are pretty much the same in my opinion in term of composition.  However, this entry took a different composition.  I just love hose of the pump in the car.  The hose leads the viewers'' eyes.  There''s so much going on here.  The man pumping petrol, the hose, the car, the gas machine, the man is watching and the light above him.  Great shot!  10!</td>', 'I really like this shot a lot, and I hope it makes it to the top three.  The other entries are pretty much the same in my opinion in term of composition.  However, this entry took a different composition.  I just love hose of the pump in the car.  The hose leads the viewers'' eyes.  There''s so much going on here.  The man pumping petrol, the hose, the car, the gas machine, the man is watching and the light above him.  Great shot!  10!', '2009-02-24 18:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272778, 766271, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like it, Nice clean shot, though I may have cropped it a touch wider on the left. You probably had some stuff on the left that would have then resulted in a critique of "distractions". (Can''t win!)</td>', 'I like it, Nice clean shot, though I may have cropped it a touch wider on the left. You probably had some stuff on the left that would have then resulted in a critique of "distractions". (Can''t win!)', '2009-02-24 20:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272789, 766274, 51747, '<td valign="top">There''s a camera in that there mirror! Somebody''s watchin you!</td>', 'There''s a camera in that there mirror! Somebody''s watchin you!', '2009-02-24 20:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272790, 765021, 83313, '<td valign="top">This shot is really dark and dull, but it has detail that can be brought out.  I copied it into PaintShop pro and the histogram showed the distibution of light and dark had nothing on the rightmost 1/3. A quick levels adjustment improved it big time. A couple of other easy tweaks (curves, saturation, clarify, contrast &amp; sharpening) really added some pop to the shot.</td>', 'This shot is really dark and dull, but it has detail that can be brought out.  I copied it into PaintShop pro and the histogram showed the distibution of light and dark had nothing on the rightmost 1/3. A quick levels adjustment improved it big time. A couple of other easy tweaks (curves, saturation, clarify, contrast & sharpening) really added some pop to the shot.', '2009-02-24 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272798, 765815, 51747, '<td valign="top">Greed is everywhere. Nice message.</td>', 'Greed is everywhere. Nice message.', '2009-02-24 20:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272809, 765848, 83313, '<td valign="top">Glad to see I''m not the only one crawling on the ground trying to get perspectives. Comes off slightly dull, however. I popped it into PSP to see, and did a quick levels adjust (the histogram was flat on the left). That minor adjustment really added some punch to the composition by enhancing the darker edges and guiding the eye in.</td>', 'Glad to see I''m not the only one crawling on the ground trying to get perspectives. Comes off slightly dull, however. I popped it into PSP to see, and did a quick levels adjust (the histogram was flat on the left). That minor adjustment really added some punch to the composition by enhancing the darker edges and guiding the eye in.', '2009-02-24 21:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272819, 766058, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of compression artifacts around the red letters, but your file size is already at the challenge limit, so I don''t know why it is so bad. You should not have had to use a lot of compression for this image, and the file size indicates you didn''t. (I''m a little anal about JPEG compression!)</td>', 'I see a lot of compression artifacts around the red letters, but your file size is already at the challenge limit, so I don''t know why it is so bad. You should not have had to use a lot of compression for this image, and the file size indicates you didn''t. (I''m a little anal about JPEG compression!)', '2009-02-24 21:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272827, 765325, 83313, '<td valign="top">The curving composition leads my eye nicely. Perhaps a little more punch in the colors would make it more DPC-friendly, but I like it. I popped it into PSP to see and though it killed some detail, some minor adjustments did give it more visual punch.</td>', 'The curving composition leads my eye nicely. Perhaps a little more punch in the colors would make it more DPC-friendly, but I like it. I popped it into PSP to see and though it killed some detail, some minor adjustments did give it more visual punch.', '2009-02-24 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272836, 764811, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m losing count of how many times I have seen this gas station in this challenge! Looks like you were all there at different times, however.<br/> <br/>Biggest issue I see is some visible tilt that can be corrected under basic rules. The pole is a composition problem, but hey, that''s what the place looks like, can''t do much about it.</td>', 'I''m losing count of how many times I have seen this gas station in this challenge! Looks like you were all there at different times, however. Biggest issue I see is some visible tilt that can be corrected under basic rules. The pole is a composition problem, but hey, that''s what the place looks like, can''t do much about it.', '2009-02-24 21:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272840, 765563, 99412, '<td valign="top">So what do ya suppose killed him? the poor feller.<br/>10<br/>:)</td>', 'So what do ya suppose killed him? the poor feller.10:)', '2009-02-24 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272842, 766215, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the play of lines with the overhead wires that would normally be a distraction in a photo. Some adjustments to give it a more eye-popping red might make it more DPC-friendly.</td>', 'I like the play of lines with the overhead wires that would normally be a distraction in a photo. Some adjustments to give it a more eye-popping red might make it more DPC-friendly.', '2009-02-24 21:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
