(5272874, 766294, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, but i see an excessive amount of JPEG artifacts showing. Your file size of only 74k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'Nice, but i see an excessive amount of JPEG artifacts showing. Your file size of only 74k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-02-24 21:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272885, 765792, 99412, '<td valign="top">Well, can you at least wash the windshield?<br/>8<br/>:)</td>', 'Well, can you at least wash the windshield?8:)', '2009-02-24 21:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
