(5272894, 766161, 83313, '<td valign="top">No vote, comment only. However, you get the same nitpicky comment I would give if I didn''t know whose entry it was. (I did warn you to wear a thick skin on this site, didn''t I?)<br/> <br/>Nice strong perspective, great detail, and I like the strong clouds. It may be a bit too centered, but that''s just a personal preference.</td>', 'No vote, comment only. However, you get the same nitpicky comment I would give if I didn''t know whose entry it was. (I did warn you to wear a thick skin on this site, didn''t I?) Nice strong perspective, great detail, and I like the strong clouds. It may be a bit too centered, but that''s just a personal preference.', '2009-02-24 21:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272895, 766071, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can see the look you were trying for, but It''s not coming off well for me. I think the biggest part is the wideangle curvature within a frame of this shape.</td>', 'I can see the look you were trying for, but It''s not coming off well for me. I think the biggest part is the wideangle curvature within a frame of this shape.', '2009-02-24 21:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272901, 765898, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure there is anything I can suggest. It''s coming off to me as a snapshot, but I can tell you the biggest problem is the high midday sun. I have found that I have better results with midday sun by focusing on detail shots instead of broad overall scenes.</td>', 'Not sure there is anything I can suggest. It''s coming off to me as a snapshot, but I can tell you the biggest problem is the high midday sun. I have found that I have better results with midday sun by focusing on detail shots instead of broad overall scenes.', '2009-02-24 21:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
