(5273296, 765812, 52449, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by onesaint:</b></div><hr/><i> Popular gas station! I was asked not to use a tripod at night there. I like the sepia. Nice work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL! Yeah, I brought my tripod but left it in the car since there were tons of people walking around there that day.</td>', 'Originally posted by onesaint: Popular gas station! I was asked not to use a tripod at night there. I like the sepia. Nice work.  LOL! Yeah, I brought my tripod but left it in the car since there were tons of people walking around there that day.', '2009-02-25 00:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
