(5273384, 766150, 52449, '<td valign="top">What a coincidence! We arranged the same composition--except our two gas stations are about 1,100 miles apart. Here is mine (in Los Angeles):<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=765812" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/995/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_765812.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/995/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_765812.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/995/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_765812.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-26 15:07:39.</i></td>', 'What a coincidence! We arranged the same composition--except our two gas stations are about 1,100 miles apart. Here is mine (in Los Angeles):', '2009-02-25 00:41:25.000000', '2009-02-26 15:07:39.000000', 0),
