(5273754, 765395, 102994, '<td valign="top">I knew when I entered this shot that I wouldnt get a high score. On first glance, yea it can look a bit rubbish... but if you can take the time to look at it properly, its actually not a bad shot.<br/>I personally like the fact that you cant make everything out, that the houses are just blobs of colour, and you can just make out the outlines of the cars/pumps etc. I also like the fact that I managed to retain the Shell logos and numbers on the pumps.<br/>I knew noone else would submit a shot like this, so at least it was original! Anyway, a normal picture of a petrol station in the UK wouldnt be very exciting unless it was dark, but I couldnt find the time to get out in the hours of darkness in the time we had to get this shot. So I went with this.<br/>Happy some people appreciate it like I do. Alot of the comments were rude and pointless. I like constructive criticism, but if your going to be plain rude, dont bother commenting! It doesnt exactly help ameteurs like myself!<br/>Guess I will see this shot emerge again in the next ribbon challenge!</td>', 'I knew when I entered this shot that I wouldnt get a high score. On first glance, yea it can look a bit rubbish... but if you can take the time to look at it properly, its actually not a bad shot.I personally like the fact that you cant make everything out, that the houses are just blobs of colour, and you can just make out the outlines of the cars/pumps etc. I also like the fact that I managed to retain the Shell logos and numbers on the pumps.I knew noone else would submit a shot like this, so at least it was original! Anyway, a normal picture of a petrol station in the UK wouldnt be very exciting unless it was dark, but I couldnt find the time to get out in the hours of darkness in the time we had to get this shot. So I went with this.Happy some people appreciate it like I do. Alot of the comments were rude and pointless. I like constructive criticism, but if your going to be plain rude, dont bother commenting! It doesnt exactly help ameteurs like myself!Guess I will see this shot emerge again in the next ribbon challenge!', '2009-02-25 05:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5273756, 766056, 79955, '<td valign="top">congrats Joe !! definitely deserves the ribbon. Fabulous</td>', 'congrats Joe !! definitely deserves the ribbon. Fabulous', '2009-02-25 05:11:32.000000', NULL, 0),
