(5275380, 764987, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>WONDERFUL!!  Dark, lower key choice here works well (not every image on the face of the earth needs to be BRIGHT).  The rich but dark red works well with the dark textures, and there is a sense of solid reality.  The angled composition sets up the lines well.  Nice!!</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!WONDERFUL!!  Dark, lower key choice here works well (not every image on the face of the earth needs to be BRIGHT).  The rich but dark red works well with the dark textures, and there is a sense of solid reality.  The angled composition sets up the lines well.  Nice!!', '2009-02-25 23:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
